1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:42,000
The problem: trading intelligence lacks privacy, proof, attribution and safe execution.

2
00:00:42,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Strategies become permissioned, forkable objects with public evidence and permanent lineage.

3
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:37,000
Timestamped public or sealed Plays make trading calls accountable.

4
00:01:37,000 --> 00:02:03,000
Search live NEAR markets, request a 1Click quote, approve in your wallet, and verify settlement.

5
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:52,000
User-owned agents: dedicated NEAR accounts, KMS-isolated keys, hard policy limits, receipts and revocation.

6
00:02:52,000 --> 00:03:33,400
Encrypted storage, scoped access, verified revenue splits—and an honest boundary between live and Demo data.
